ITEM AV — Verification of MFLAG 'D' Mechanism and Quantization
--------------------------------------------------------------
1. Statistical Test of D Share vs Season Ratio (n=14):
   - r = -0.627, t = -2.788, p-value = 0.0164.
   - Note: D share is exactly zero in 9 of 14 seasons (all seasons 2006–2019), so D share functions as a pre-2006 indicator variable.
   - The regime break survives independently on the ratio subsets alone:
     * Pre-2004 (n=3): 0.561 ± 0.025
     * 2004-onward (n=11): 1.032 ± 0.265 (p < 0.01 by two-sample t-test).
2. Quantization Test:
   - At 0.254 mm (0.01 in): Pre-2004 = 26.8% vs Post-2004 = 27.2% (identical).
   - At 2.5 mm: Pre-2004 = 2.6% vs Post-2004 = 2.3%.
   - Ten most frequent daily positive values:
     * Pre-2004: 0.5 mm (11.6%), 0.3 mm (9.5%), 2.0 mm (8.4%), 3.0 mm (7.4%), 4.1 mm (6.3%), 1.0 mm (6.3%), 5.1 mm (5.8%), 0.8 mm (5.3%), 7.9 mm (3.7%), 3.3 mm (2.6%).
     * Post-2004: 3.0 mm (7.7%), 0.5 mm (7.2%), 1.0 mm (6.3%), 0.3 mm (6.2%), 2.0 mm (5.8%), 5.1 mm (4.5%), 0.8 mm (4.3%), 7.1 mm (3.0%), 4.1 mm (2.9%), 6.1 mm (2.9%).
   - The repeated 55.1 mm is a numerical coincidence, not a unit conversion artifact.


