ITEM BB — Restatement of the Product Claim
------------------------------------------
One-line claim supported by signed numbers:
Across 16,943 villages, 5.81% (984 villages) exceed the ±150 m (~1.0 °C) lapse-rate threshold—2.51% (425 villages) require cooling adjustments up to −3.97 °C (Torane/Feature 7508, MH, +610.7 m) and 3.30% (559 villages) require warming adjustments up to +3.84 °C (Bamnoli, MH, −590.3 m)—demonstrating that subgrid topographic downscaling produces bidirectional temperature corrections of up to ±4.0 °C.
